<title>NORWAY: Orkla 8-month pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Orkla 8-month pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31.</p>
<p>			   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating revenue	   16,744     vs	  13,126</p>
<p>Operating profit	     1,281     vs	   1,105</p>
<p>Profit before tax	    1,748     vs	   1,383</p>
<p>Profit after tax	     1,235     vs	   1,029</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian food, beverage, chemicals and media conglomerate is Orkla ASA. A Reuter poll of eight analysts forecast an operating result of 1.23 billion crowns and a pre-tax profit of 1.53 billion crowns.  </p>
<p>Operating expenses	  14,628     vs	  11,429</p>
<p>Depreciation		     855     vs	     706</p>
<p>Financial items	  minus 253     vs   minus   195</p>
<p>Profit from associated</p>
<p>		   companies     140     vs	     115</p>
<p>Gains/losses on securities   580     vs	     358</p>
<p>Tax/minority interests	 513     vs	     354</p>
<p>Earnings per share (crowns)   25.7   vs	21.4</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
